--- !u!114 &1412881873
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1412881871}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=130%><b><color=#FFD54F>N\u1ED8I DUNG B\xC0I THI SA H\xCCNH B2</color></b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 1: Xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t</color></b></size>\r\n- Th\u1EAFt d\xE2y an to\xE0n, b\u1EADt xi nhan v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA1p ch\xE2n ga 1 l\u1EA7n => xe di chuy\u1EC3n v\xE0 c\xF3 nhan.\r\n- Khi qua v\u1EA1ch c\xF3 1 ti\u1EBFng b\xE1o hi\u1EC7u: T\u1EAFt xi nhan. N\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng t\u1EAFt xi nhan tr\u1EEB 5 \u0111i\u1EC3m ho\u1EB7c xi nhan kh\xF4ng b\u1EADt tr\u1EEB 10 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n<b><color=#FFB74D>* C\xE1c l\u1ED7i tr\u1EEB \u0111i\u1EC3m:</color></b>\r\n  \u2022 Kh\xF4ng th\u1EAFt d\xE2y an to\xE0n: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n  \u2022 Kh\xF4ng b\u1EADt \u0111\xE8n xi nhan tr\xE1i khi xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n  \u2022 Kh\xF4ng t\u1EAFt \u0111\xE8n xi nhan tr\xE1i \u1EDF kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch 5m sau v\u1EA1ch xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t (\u0111\xE8n xanh tr\xEAn xe t\u1EAFt): -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n  \u2022 Kh\xF4ng b\u1EADt v\xE0 t\u1EAFt \u0111\xE8n xi nhan tr\xE1i k\u1ECBp th\u1EDDi: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n  \u2022 Qu\xE1 20 gi\xE2y k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB khi c\xF3 l\u1EC7nh xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t m\xE0 v\u1EABn kh\xF4ng qua v\u1EA1ch: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n  \u2022 \u0110\u1EC3 xe ch\u1EBFt m\xE1y: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m/l\u1EA7n.\r\n  \u2022 T\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u01A1 qu\xE1 4000 v\xF2ng/ph\xFAt: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n  \u2022 L\xE1i xe v\u01B0\u1EE3t t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 quy \u0111\u1ECBnh: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n<b><color=#FF6B6B>* B\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp:</color></b>\r\n  \u2022 Qu\xE1 30 gi\xE2y k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB khi c\xF3 l\u1EC7nh m\xE0 xe ch\u01B0a v\u01B0\u1EE3t v\u1EA1ch xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t.\r\n  \u2022 G\xE2y tai n\u1EA1n ho\u1EB7c l\xE1i xe l\xEAn v\u1EC9a h\xE8.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 2: D\u1EEBng xe nh\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i b\u1ED9</color></b></size>\r\n- C\xE1ch 1 \u0111o\u1EA1n c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i n\xEAu t\xEAn b\xE0i thi; Point check l\xE0 tay n\u1EAFm c\u1EEDa.\r\n- D\u1EEBng xe ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1ECB tr\xED: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n- D\u1EEBng qu\xE1 v\u1EA1ch quy \u0111\u1ECBnh: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 3: D\u1EEBng xe v\xE0 kh\u1EDFi h\xE0nh ngang d\u1ED1c</color></b></size>\r\n- Point check l\xE0 g\u01B0\u01A1ng. Khi \u0111\u1EA7u xe ch\u1EA1m qua v\u1EA1ch s\u1EBD c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng b\xE1o hi\u1EC7u.\r\n- D\u1EEBng xe ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1ECB tr\xED: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n- \u0110u\xF4i xe qua v\u1EA1ch m\xE0 kh\xF4ng d\u1EEBng ph\u1EA3i thi l\u1EA1i: Load l\u1EA1i scene.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 4: Qua v\u1EC7t b\xE1nh xe v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EB9p vu\xF4ng g\xF3c</color></b></size>\r\n- B\xE1o khi \u0111i v\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng cua: Ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i b\xE1o hi\u1EC7u.\r\n- B\xE1nh xe ch\u1EA1m v\u1EA1ch: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n ch\u1EA1m.\r\n- Kh\xF4ng \u0111i qua v\u1EC7t b\xE1nh xe: Tru\u1EA5t quy\u1EC1n thi (Load l\u1EA1i scene).\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 5: Qua ng\xE3 4 c\xF3 t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n giao th\xF4ng</color></b></size>\r\n- Ch\u1EA5p h\xE0nh t\xEDn hi\u1EC7u giao th\xF4ng, d\u1EEBng xe c\xE1ch v\u1EA1ch kh\xF4ng qu\xE1 0,5m, qua ng\xE3 4 trong th\u1EDDi gian 20s.\r\n- \u0110i qua ng\xE3 4 khi \u0111\xE8n \u0111\u1ECF: -10 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n- D\u1EEBng c\xE1ch ho\u1EB7c qu\xE1 v\u1EA1ch tr\xEAn 0,5m: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n- Ch\u1EBFt m\xE1y: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m/l\u1EA7n.\r\n- Kh\xF4ng b\u1EADt \u0111\xFAng xi nhan qua ng\xE3 4: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n- T\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 v\xF2ng quay > 4000 v\xF2ng/ph\xFAt: c\u1EE9 3s tr\u1EEB 1 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 6: \u0110i xe qua \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xF2ng quanh co (ch\u1EEF S)</color></b></size>\r\n- Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1 b\xE0i 5 (b\xE1nh xe ch\u1EA1m v\u1EA1ch tr\u1EEB 5 \u0111i\u1EC3m/l\u1EA7n).\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 7: Gh\xE9p xe v\xE0o n\u01A1i \u0111\u1ED7 (L\xF9i nh\xE0 xe d\u1ECDc)</color></b></size>\r\n- Th\u1EDDi gian th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n: 2 ph\xFAt.\r\n- M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n ch\u1EA1m v\u1EA1ch: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m (c\u1EE9 m\u1ED7i 2 gi\xE2y).\r\n- Qu\xE1 2 ph\xFAt: -5 \u0111i\u1EC3m (m\u1ED7i 2 ph\xFAt tr\u1EEB 5 \u0111i\u1EC3m).\r\n- B\xE1nh xe kh\xF4ng ch\u1EA1m v\u1EA1ch ki\u1EC3m tra cu\u1ED1i nh\xE0 xe: B\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i.\r\n- V\xE0o nh\u1EA7m nh\xE0 xe h\u1EA1ng kh\xE1c: B\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 8: D\u1EEBng xe n\u01A1i giao nhau v\u1EDBi \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng s\u1EAFt</color></b></size>\r\n- Quy t\u1EAFc d\u1EEBng v\xE0 tr\u1EEB \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1 B\xE0i 2.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 9: T\u0103ng t\u1ED1c, t\u0103ng s\u1ED1</color></b></size>\r\n- Thao t\xE1c chuy\u1EC3n s\u1ED1 v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA1t t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u theo bi\u1EC3n b\xE1o.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 10: Gh\xE9p xe ngang - \u0110\u1ED7 xe song song</color></b></size>\r\n- Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u v\xE0 quy t\u1EAFc t\xEDnh \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1 B\xE0i 7.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>B\xE0i 11: T\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng nguy hi\u1EC3m</color></b></size>\r\n- Khi loa b\xE1o c\xF2i h\xFA v\xE0 \u0111\xE8n \u0111\u1ECF nh\u1EA5p nh\xE1y, n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng phanh d\u1EEBng trong 3s: -10 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n- Khi h\u1EBFt b\xE1o \u0111\u1ED9ng, n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng \u1EA5n t\u1EAFt n\xFAt kh\u1EA9n c\u1EA5p trong 5s: -10 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n\r\n<size=112%><b><color=#66E39A>QUY \u0110\u1ECANH CHUNG</color></b></size>\r\n- D\u01B0\u1EDBi 80 \u0111i\u1EC3m: Tru\u1EA5t quy\u1EC1n s\xE1t h\u1EA1ch (Thi tr\u01B0\u1EE3t).\r\n- T\u1ED5ng th\u1EDDi gian qu\xE1 15 ph\xFAt: C\u1EE9 qu\xE1 3 gi\xE2y tr\u1EEB 10 \u0111i\u1EC3m.\r\n"
